{"3394540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JoshGeoff Weiner Simulator", "steam_appid": 3394540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras/fc7cb50e8fb2e2c63d5a78e2a7180efd.avif?t=1778641049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras_big/fc7cb50e8fb2e2c63d5a78e2a7180efd.avif?t=1778641049 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forever Lost In A Maze...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >following your boss around different cities across the UK, from silly goofy Train Stations to the iconic F1 track, collect different items like a totally-not-phallic sausage for JoshGeoff, your ring leader boss. What will happen if you don't get these items... you don't want to know since it'll be your worst, and last nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JoshGeoff Weiner Simulator Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, we have 6 maps available during Early Access, with more to come in the future leading up to Full Release! The current maps include, Weiner Town, Kiev Central, Silverstone, Bus Station, Bike Depot... and our newest addition, Strawb Street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras/69705efd9b96d060dc8f14a06069f1c4.avif?t=1778641049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras_big/69705efd9b96d060dc8f14a06069f1c4.avif?t=1778641049 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam